        <activityName xml:lang="en">Paper, woodfree, coated, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Paper, woodfree, coated, at regional storage
na;
UUID: a4e533f6-f149-3ddf-b98e-4a0ab7730686
This module includes the transport from the production site to a central distribution site within average Europe for the domestic and the foreign coated fine paper consumed in average Europe.; Geography: Deliveries within Europe according to CEPI statistics. 
Location:  Deliveries within Europe according to CEPI statistics. 
Technology: Average situation
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: Total European consumption 2000: 9'000 kt (CEPI statistics)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: Standard distances for domestic production, imports from CEPI countries and imports from outside. Distribution integrated / non-integrated mill based on own assumption.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a4e533f6-f149-3ddf-b98e-4a0ab7730686.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
